<p>Use Feedback to replenish yourself.  This heals you for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">286, 385, 461, 527, 584</acronym> life, and restores <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">28, 38, 46, 52, 58</acronym> stamina, <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">51, 69, 83, 94, 105</acronym> mana, <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">42, 57, 69, 79, 87</acronym> equilibrium, <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">28, 38, 46, 52, 58</acronym> vim, <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">14, 19, 23, 26, 29</acronym> positive and negative energies, <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">20, 26, 32, 36, 40</acronym> psi energy, and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">7, 9, 11, 13, 14</acronym> hate.</p><p>The heal and resource gain will improve with your Mindpower.</p>